["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">勲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>功勋；功绩</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">クン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いさお</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">魔</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>恶魔；魔鬼；妖术</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">悪魔</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あくま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">魔鬼；恶魔；妖魔；撒旦；魔鬼；魔罗；阻碍修行的邪魔</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誤魔化す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ごまかす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">欺骗；诈骗；蒙骗；伪造；篡改；虚报；窜改；做假账；逃避（问题、税款等）；搪塞；掩饰（错误、过失等）；蒙混过关；敷衍了事；贪污；中饱私囊；侵吞</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">酬</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>报答；报酬；酬谢</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ・シュ・トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">むく.いる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">報酬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほうしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">报酬；酬劳；报偿；代价</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">紫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>紫色；紫</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">むらさき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">紫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むらさき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">紫色；紫罗兰色；紫草（Lithospermum erythrorhizon）；酱油</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">曙</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>黎明；拂晓</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あけぼの</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">紋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>家纹；图案</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">モン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">卸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>批发；卸下；卸货</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シャ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おろ.す・おろし・おろ.し</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">卸す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おろす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">批发；批发出售；磨碎；刨碎（蔬菜等）；切割鱼；剖鱼</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">奮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>振奋；振作；活跃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふる.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">興奮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうふん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">兴奋；刺激；激动；唤起</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">奮闘</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふんとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">奋力；苦战；顽强拼搏；激战；激烈战斗</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">欄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>栏（表格/报纸的栏目）；扶手；空白；空格</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ラン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">てすり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">欄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">らん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">栏；栏目；版面；栏位；空白框；字段；栏杆；扶手；护栏</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">逸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>偏离；逸失；闲暇；躲避；错过</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そ.れる・そ.らす・はぐ.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">逸れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">それる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">转向；偏离；躲开；错过（如目标）；偏离；离题；脱离正轨；走神</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">逸らす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そらす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">转向；转开；移开（眼睛、脸等