g=\"ja\">獄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>监狱；牢狱</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゴク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">地獄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じごく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地狱道；那落迦；（基督教）地狱；地狱；苦难；噩梦；火山或温泉不断喷出烟雾或蒸汽的地方</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">尚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>崇尚；尚且；还；仍然；更加</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なお</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">高尚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">高尚；高雅；精妙；高级</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">尚更</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なおさら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">更加；愈发；尤其；更不；更不用说；更谈不上</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">阜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>山丘；土堆</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ・フウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">彫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>雕刻；凿刻；雕琢</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほ.る・-ぼ.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">彫刻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">雕刻；雕塑；刻画</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">彫る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">雕刻；镌刻；雕凿；纹身；刺青</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">穏</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>平静；安稳；温和；稳重</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おだ.やか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">穏やか</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おだやか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">平静；宁静；温和；安宁；温柔；适度；合理；友善</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">巧</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>巧妙；精巧；灵巧；擅长；巧思</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たく.み・たく.む・うま.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">巧妙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうみょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">巧妙；灵巧；精巧；精妙</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">精巧</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">精巧；精致；精美</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">巧み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たくみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">巧妙；灵巧；精妙；狡猾；技巧；工艺；技巧性；计谋；诡计；花招；伎俩</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=